231	1	.A. above; <br><br>• A facility that is subject to the requirements of chapter V of the FD&C Act (for <br><br>drugs and devices) (see section 613(a) of the FD&C Act). The exception from the \nfacility registration requirements of section 607 of the FD&C Act does not apply if \nthat same facility also manufactures or processes cosmetic products that are not \nsubject to the requirements of chapter V of the FD&C Act (see section 613(b) of the \nFD&C Act). <br><br>As provided under section 607(a)(3) of the FD&C Act, if a facility manufactures or processes \ncosmetic products on behalf of a responsible person (i.e., a contract manufacturer), only a \nsingle registration is required for such facility even if the facility is manufacturing or \nprocessing its own cosmetic products or cosmetic products on behalf of more than one \nresponsible person. A responsible person whose products are manufactured or processed at \nsuch facility may submit the facility registration for such facility. Under this approach, an \nowner or operator of a contract manufacturing facility would not register such facility if the \nresponsible person submitted the facility registration.	[646,1811)	[-0.032255143,-0.7322405,0.6910908,0.19360065,0.34063363,-0.1806559,0.39545533,-0.81206155,0.12105482,1.0350645,-0.668372,-0.50980204,-0.14465772,-0.0138477795,-0.25894716,0.56412715,-0.49902922,-0.5374217,-0.5109286,-0.21429071,-0.5144964,-0.8146968,-0.46152773,0.37690476,0.194861,0.074965544,0.3014321,0.14683172,0.6258454,0.3281533,0.24629861,0.2620386,-0.07853499,-0.323688,-0.17629993,-0.2384876,-0.96258867,0.16880636,0.15813999,0.6062877,-0.49963713,-0.28932005,-0.21195371,0.7502202,-0.8042072,-0.10464186,-0.14548701,-0.11715122,-0.17817388,-0.05037736,-0.27172253,-0.59517974,0.16371183,-0.4395767,1.0944293,0.13568178,1.2286918,0.377541,-0.5231219,-0.10395939,-0.5773202,0.49564117,-0.4613803,0.33976686,0.0035007896,0.17419282,-0.41804123,-1.1153187,-0.28914815,-0.13101393,-0.57814455,-0.033314