282	1	**Q20. What are the responsibilities of a U.S. Agent?**<br><br>A. The responsibilities of the U.S. agent are limited and generally include: <br><br>• assisting FDA in communications with the foreign establishment; \n• responding to questions concerning the foreign establishment's products that are imported <br><br>or offered for import into the United States; <br><br>• assisting FDA in scheduling inspections of the foreign establishment; and \n• receiving information or documents from FDA on behalf of the foreign establishment <br><br>when FDA is unable to contact the foreign establishment directly or expeditiously. FDA \nproviding such information or documents to the U.S. Agent will be considered equivalent \nto providing the same information or documents to the foreign establishment. <br><br>We also note that FDA does not recommend or endorse any particular U.S. agent. <br><br>.	[0,897)	[0.115229055,-0.16122925,0.51939034,0.027447104,-0.25033262,-0.2612113,0.21238737,-1.272457,0.3668917,1.019546,-0.4813781,-0.20133643,-0.33923542,0.5478044,0.19585143,1.121778,-0.22895914,0.3264752,-0.51563144,0.278836,-0.48105174,-0.25829285,-0.8466069,-0.096404724,0.68614304,0.6019684,0.6749101,0.47129217,1.0538822,0.47560918,0.5913036,-0.13228694,-0.055743523,0.08679552,-0.36400214,-0.47968325,-1.0654141,0.518599,-0.2144707,0.25331718,-0.2586671,0.15726265,-0.5268116,0.41054678,-0.36714077,0.11605934,-0.019876229,0.044387985,0.30738825,-0.21033427,-0.116328605,-0.5772854,0.63632494,-0.75685257,0.19345695,0.25397575,1.090432,0.14923161,-1.0495564,-0.37680337,-0.40134457,0.4061349,-0.4994565,0.39270437,0.7648607,0.45956513,-0.3237111,-0.8905002,-0.2151385,-0.7150969,-0.46239012,0.085868545,-0.27982315,0.1344932,0.14903067,0.38641518,-0.6599341,-0.68001074,-0.6807777,-0.62147266,0.9293785,-0.115630485,0.62365144,0.5187017,-0.44358557,-0.18293557,-0.53664374,0.35270962,0.057010774,0.19482338,0.24393123,0.30208537,-0.22585988,0.08568933,0.120080166,0.2104271,-0.0627337,-0.63494