353	1	FDA may request that records and other information be in English or accompanied by an English \ntranslation.36 If translated, the translation should be complete and accurate, and, when applicable, should \ninclude the name, address, and a brief statement of the qualifications of the translator. Copies of the \noriginal records and information should also be included in the response, where appropriate. For certain \nRRAs, if a verified translation is not immediately available, FDA may request that the initial translation \nbe followed up with a verified translation as soon as practicable.  417 \n418 \n419 \n420 \n421 \n422 <br><br>If the records or other information are provided as part of a section 704(a)(4) request, the records and \ninformation may be submitted in either electronic or physical form. FDA will provide confirmation upon \nreceipt of the records. 37 In general, FDA intends to maintain open communications to discuss any records \nreceived over the course of the RRA.  423 \n424 \n425 \n426 <br><br>For RRAs under 21 CFR 1.510(b)(3) and 1.512(b)(5)(ii)(C), records must be sent electronically, or \nthrough any other means that delivers the records promptly upon written request from FDA.  427 \n428	[0,1208)	[0.11883687,-0.4298237,0.4986709,0.2717404,-0.57456297,-0.674609,0.14072439,-1.0393773,0.57724047,0.81534874,-0.37929,-0.54659396,-0.91288084,0.5830892,-0.34348184,1.3490173,-0.2942378,0.3204405,-0.05876619,-0.176867,-0.528076,-0.28068614,-0.39752576,-0.014009967,0.8044218,0.5419229,0.32753718,1.0435109,0.97360194,0.3737514,0.22730128,-0.06773208,-0.16415389,0.05124373,-0.092082195,-0.85379046,-1.1656924,-0.13653661,0.37782285,0.13517828,-0.49913538,0.5348538,-0.6601278,0.9542241,-0.32410628,0.16478516,-0.16139539,0.2417808,-0.33710706,-0.5047336,-0.42618603,-0.861776,0.12727872,-0.6097364,0.07500346,0.43215194,1.2165904,-0.13961853,-0.5597472,-0.4392644,-0.73612416,0.41829306,-0.92978984,0.52755475,0.76871336,0.35311314,-0.3858258,-0.817159,-0.535