626	1	><br>Identify the reason for the recall and any potential health hazard(s) \nassociated with it. Ensure the statement is clear, directly conveys the risk, \nand prompts an urgent response by the reader. <br><br> <br><br>c. DEPTH OF THE RECALL: <br><br> The recall communication should clearly identify the depth to which the \nrecall is to extend (e.g., wholesale, retail, consumer or user level). For \nexample, if the recall is to the retail level, a statement should read "This \nrecall should be carried out to the retail level." <br><br> <br><br>If the product could have been further distributed by your direct account \nconsignees to their customers, then you should include instructions to sub- \nrecall. Sub-recall instructions should also include a statement about the \ndepth of the recall, e.g., "If you have further distributed this product, <br><br>5 See 21 CFR 7.3(g), (h), (j), and (k) for the definitions of “recall,” “correction,” “market withdrawal,” and “stock \nrecovery,” respectively.	[203,1226)	[-0.1586064,-0.23167214,0.05821252,0.32970488,0.018362029,-0.110107295,0.5248078,-0.72087747,0.50510037,0.7629648,-0.5266611,-0.64159894,-0.22660428,-0.15551336,-0.49640954,0.9321939,-0.28410232,-0.7062705,0.13767114,0.12818615,-1.0075883,-0.8021285,-0.6816225,-0.2615092,0.53998095,0.92912984,0.15161908,0.086224765,0.49445042,0.2640008,-0.14190415,-0.07837589,-0.6389921,-0.048685778,-0.48318475,-0.4328659,-0.82507354,-0.17901202,0.01829285,0.25481975,-0.49335703,-0.047685232,-0.061233528,1.0788358,-0.8121095,-0.02506105,-0.18349566,0.23263785,0.34172893,-0.15057844,-0.4891323,-0.3867657,0.3877989,-0.7256861,0.18786398,0.14399154,0.7011895,-0.2653232,-0.6421153,-0.5642727,-1.0262783,0.47618923,-0.47009063,0.09827521,0.46343157,0.23205712,0.21499275,-0.6345484,-0.28609088,0.22835357,-0.5477164,0.421225,-0.47372437,0.080032475,0.36512825,0.8610177,-0.17911455,-0.22555767,-0.758411,0.06715724,0.63621616,0.22310992,0.029077422,0.00021189055,-0.5084262,-0.13136274